Simulation assumptions for purpose of identifying the number of DMRS symbols for long PUCCH format without multiplexing capability for more than 2 bits UCI payload
System bandwidth = 20Mhz
Subcarrier spacing = {15kHz, 30 kHz}
TDL-C channel with delay spread = {300nS, 1000nS}
# UE Tx =1, # gNB Rx =2 ( Optional: # gNB Rx = 4 and 32)
Payload sizes without CRC: 20bits, 60bits, 100 bits (only for 14 symbols long PUCCH)
Number of RB = {1 RB}
Carrier frequency = 4Ghz
Number of UEs = {1}
UE speed: 3km/h, 120km/h, 500km/h at least for 20 bits
Polar code with 8+3 CRC and/or TBCC with 8 CRC bits
Practical channel estimation and ideal noise estimation
